registration make it sidebar-reachable and `/power/grafana` deep-linkable, preserving every RouteTests
invariant. Verified on BOTH idioms by isolated Swift 6 strict-concurrency type-checks (macOS 0/0 + iOS
0/0, incl. previews) and the executed model/route/logic harness (36/36 — catalog/sort, prettyJSON
byte-for-byte, copy/clear/apply, drafter wiring, route). The full xcodebuild scheme was NOT run — it is
